// @@@ For each index i between 0 and the length of this BitSet, the value of the bit at index i is the result of the logical AND operation between the old value of the bit at index i and the negation of the value of the bit at index i in the specified BitSet.
--------------------
// @@@ For each index i between 0 and the length of this BitSet, the bit at index i in this BitSet is equal to the bitwise AND of the bit at index i in the old BitSet and the bitwise NOT of the bit at index i in the specified BitSet.
